ion":"14550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀汉官员，东汉尚书令裴茂第二子，曹魏重臣裴潜之弟。出身河东裴氏，十多岁时随姐夫（蜀郡长史）入蜀，因汉末战乱滞留益州，凭借才德累迁至蜀汉光禄勋。","tc":"蜀漢官員，東漢尚書令裴茂第二子，曹魏重臣裴潛之弟。出身河東裴氏，十多歲時隨姐夫（蜀郡長史）入蜀，因漢末戰亂滯留益州，憑借才德累遷至蜀漢光祿勛。","en":"An official of Shu Han, the second son of Eastern Han Secretary General Pei Mao, and the younger brother of prominent Cao Wei minister Pei Qian. Hailing from the Pei clan of Hedong, he entered Shu in his teens following his brother-in-law (the Jnr Secretary of Shu Commandery). Stranded in Yi Province by the turmoil at the end of the Han dynasty, he rose through the ranks by virtue of his talent and integrity, ultimately serving as Chancellor of Shu Han.","jp":"蜀漢の官吏。後漢の尚書令・裴茂の次男で、曹魏の重臣・裴潜の弟。名門・河東裴氏の出身。十代の頃に義兄（蜀郡長史）に従って入蜀したが、漢末の戦乱により益州に留まることとなった。その才徳によって累進し、蜀漢の光禄勲にまで至った。","kr":"촉한의 관원으로, 동한의 상서령 배무의 차남이자 조위의 중신 배잠의 아우입니다. 하동 배씨 출신으로, 10여 세 때 매형(촉군장사)을 따라 촉에 들어갔다가 한말의 전란으로 익주에 머물게 되었습니다. 이후 재덕으로 누진하여 촉한의 광록훈에 이르렀습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1040115","remark":"","surname":"裴","surnameTc":"裴","surnameEn":"Pei","surnameJp":"裴","surnameKr":"배","surnameOther":"","name":"儁","nameTc":"儁","nameEn":"Jun","nameJp":"儁","nameKr":"준","nameOther":"","word":"奉先","wordTc":"奉先","wordEn":"Fengxian","wordJp":"奉先","wordKr":"봉선","wordOther":"","icon":"裴儁","power":"WJ10011","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"193","city":"CS1027","gender":"0","rule":"25","force":"22","wise":"70","politics":"69","charm":"69","will":"79","ruleTalent":"3","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"14","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"8/8/70/8/8/88/29/8","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"